# UXCore Tailwind Intents

Before writing or modifying any `intents-ux-` Tailwind classes, read `app/uxcore-tailwind.md` for the complete reference of valid intent names, properties, and prefixes.

Common mistakes to avoid:

❌ `text-intents-ux-error-textColor` → ✅ `text-intents-ux-feedbackHighContrastCritical-feedbackColor`
❌ `text-intents-ux-textSubtle-textColor` → ✅ `text-intents-ux-feedbackHighContrastPassive-feedbackColor`
❌ `text-intents-ux-text-textColor` → ✅ `text-intents-ux-box-foregroundColor`
❌ `bg-intents-ux-success-backgroundColor` → ✅ `bg-intents-ux-feedbackSuccess-feedbackColor`
❌ `bg-intents-ux-feedbackSuccess-backgroundColor` → ✅ `bg-intents-ux-feedbackSuccess-feedbackColor`
❌ `border-intents-ux-border-borderColor` → ✅ `border-intents-ux-box-borderColor`
